    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a20">

                <pb facs="0568" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg518"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 20.—From the legation of Portugal in
                        Buenos Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-27"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 27,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Corvette <hi rendition="#italic">Alfonso de Albuquerque</hi> ten days’
                    quarantine. I carried your excellency’s orders on board; commander declared me
                    impossible to go on to a Portuguese port, for lack of capacity and provisions.
                    Says it is indispensable transport of war come here. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mindello</hi> is expected to-morrow. Fugitives have not disembarked.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Faria.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
